{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346950/extras/draw.gif?t=1740901549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique story about Sanechek, a kitten-girl who lost her coins and can\u2019t afford to buy chips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decide Fate</strong>: 2 endings \u2013 can you earn enough for a bag of chips?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Empathize</strong>: An engaging story that won't leave you indifferent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go to Work</strong>: 5 unique jobs, each with their own mechanics and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346950/extras/anime.gif?t=1740901549\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paint</strong>: Solve puzzles to create artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watch</strong>: Cinematic cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Listen</strong>: Enjoy captivating soundtracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duration</strong>: ~1-2 hours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an indie project created by a solo developer who aimed to craft a game and tell a story inspired by a real character within a short timeframe.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I love cleaning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3346950/dbcfe8603c284c7713fe32498278a4aad9c61745.jpg"},{"name":"Everyone said to mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3346950/e5e99ced1e24a3d4d6faa86a5f0c23de32cfc886.jpg"},{"name":"Don't eat the boba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3346950/60c8b60adf6bb2ccca86566bc33cb9571d7792c6.jpg"},{"name":"You need to